        <h1>Welcome to MwalaJS</h1>

        <p><strong>MwalaJS</strong> is an advanced, high-performance web development framework that leverages the speed and efficiency of the Google **V8 engine**. Whether you're building applications using **JavaScript**, **Node.js**, or **Express**, MwalaJS provides a robust, scalable environment that dramatically improves application performance.</p>

        <h2>Overview of MwalaJS</h2>
        <p>MwalaJS is designed with performance in mind. By utilizing the powerful **V8 engine**, it ensures that JavaScript and Node.js applications run faster than ever before. The framework is built for modern web development, supporting various advanced features that make coding and application deployment smoother, quicker, and more scalable.</p>

        <h3>Core Features of MwalaJS</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>High Performance with Google V8 Engine:</strong> MwalaJS uses the **Google V8 engine** for JavaScript execution, making it one of the fastest frameworks available. This engine ensures rapid compilation and execution of code, significantly boosting performance.</li>
            <li><strong>Supports ES6 and .mjs Files:</strong> Unlike traditional **.js** files, MwalaJS supports **.mjs** files for modularity. This allows for cleaner, more maintainable code with better handling of import/export functionality.</li>
            <li><strong>Full Migration Support:</strong> Just like popular frameworks like **Laravel** and **Django**, MwalaJS supports **full database migrations**. This means you can handle database schema changes smoothly and without hassle, ensuring that your application stays up to date and scalable as it evolves.</li>
            <li><strong>MVC Architecture:</strong> MwalaJS follows the **Model-View-Controller (MVC)** architecture, allowing you to separate your application logic, user interface, and data. This helps keep your codebase organized and easy to maintain, making it suitable for both small projects and large-scale enterprise applications.</li>
            <li><strong>Node.js and Express Integration:</strong> MwalaJS seamlessly integrates with **Node.js** and **Express**, adding advanced functionality and enhancing their capabilities. It simplifies the process of building and deploying server-side applications, allowing developers to focus on building the features that matter.</li>
            <li><strong>Cross-Platform Development:</strong> MwalaJS is cross-platform, allowing you to develop and deploy applications on any operating system. Whether you're working on Windows, Linux, or macOS, MwalaJS ensures your applications run smoothly across all platforms.</li>
            <li><strong>Security:</strong> Security is a key focus of MwalaJS, providing built-in measures to safeguard your applications from common vulnerabilities. The framework is designed to ensure that sensitive data remains protected at all times.</li>
            <li><strong>Open Source and Community Driven:</strong> MwalaJS is an open-source framework, meaning it is continuously improved by a dedicated community of developers. You can contribute, suggest features, report bugs, and help make MwalaJS the best framework for web development.</li>
